          "output_summary": "{\"method\": \"vector\", \"embedding_model\": \"BAAI/bge-m3\", \"embedding_revision\": \"5617a9f61b028005a4858fdac845db406aefb181\", \"chunks\": [{\"chunk_id\": \"buyers\", \"source\": \"kb/metrics.md\", \"content\": \"buyers 客户数／真实客户／买家规模\\n统计观察窗口内有订单的 customer_unique_id 去重数，默认保留所有订单状态。customer_id 是订单关联标识，同人跨订单可能不同。\\n```sql\\nSELECT count(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id) AS buyers FROM orders o JOIN customers c USING(customer_id);\\n```\", \"content_sha256\": \"45f0df38c0e457ebaea454427b7c55d4ba70da1cea802890a04cc53ae6bc94d5\"}, {\"chunk_id\": \"reviewed_orders\", \"source\": \"kb/metrics.md\", \"content\": \"reviewed_orders 已评价订单／多少单获得评价\\n按订单计算是否存在评价，不能用评价行数代替订单数。一个订单可能有多条评价。\\n```sql\\nSELECT count(*) AS reviewed_orders FROM orders o WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM order_reviews r WHERE r.order_id=o.order_id);\\n```\", \"content_sha256\": \"eefe3ba0f4afd1e775438ff89b1a326781eaa6f4b2ae4285f171e55a871fdbc2\"}, {\"chunk_id\": \"orders_count\", \"source\": \"kb/metrics.md\", \"content\": \"orders_count 订单数／订单量\\n默认订单表全部状态的行数。状态偏好如 delivered 应明确过滤，订单明细的行数是件次而不是订单数。\\n```sql\\nSELECT count(*) AS orders FROM orders;\\n```\", \"content_sha256\": \"f70f18bcfa10662b07e91f182d1ebfde21c26eceacb4bb728136910e1c7cf979\"}]}"
